         [[6.179827 , 7.179827 , 8.179828 ],
          [7.5394816, 8.539482 , 9.539482 ]]], dtype=float32)>

  Returns:
    The contrast-adjusted image(s).

  Raises:
    ValueError: if `upper <= lower` or if `lower < 0`.
  "

